==Battleground==
*5 [[Chickful A]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A backliner is highly recommended to deal with the Chickful A spam. The stage does not pose much threat otherwise.

